{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong> \ud83d\udd78\ufe0f Step into the shadows of a crumbling realm where a lone <strong>Dark Knight</strong> rises from the depths of despair to face the horrors that dwell beneath. In this grim dungeon-crawling action RPG, you take control of a cursed warrior whose only path to redemption lies through blood, steel, and arcane fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Combat</strong>: Fight grotesque enemies using devastating melee combos, dark magic, and tactical dodges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Dungeon Exploration</strong>: Traverse haunted catacombs, ancient crypts, and mysterious chambers. Each room holds secrets\u2026 or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong>: Unlock powerful skills, collect enchanted gear, and forge legendary weapons to survive deeper into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal Progression System</strong>: Clear zones and activate mystical portals to return, recover, and venture further into darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong>: Pixel art meets gothic horror, blending nostalgia with atmospheric dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reflexive Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898620/62f84f5284c39a06b78deb0fa88717fd7cf1ff52.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898620/051ee61348134348421bbb99d825eb8c8880be96.jpg"},{"name":"Health","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3898620/2fe0146208e5363e4144c1b93cea69e87624733e.jpg"},{"name":"Poison","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu